    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d170dd72e8275e7",
      "translationZh": "太长不看版：我在一个基于 Proxmox/LXC 的本地推理实验环境中，运行着一对规格不匹配的 Tesla V100-PCIE——一张 16 GB 卡和一张 32 GB 卡，总计 48 GB。到目前为止，实际表现最好的是近期的 llama.cpp CUDA 构建版本，配合张量切分、Flash Attention、--numa distribute 和大批次。在 Qwen3.8 27B Q6_K_M 上，我测得的提示词处理速度分别为：2k 时 1,376.9 tok/s，4k 时 1,324.3 tok/s，16k 时 1,221.5 tok/s；解码速度为 39.9 tok/s。我还让一个总参数量为 177 B、激活参数量为 6B 的 MoE 模型的 Qwen3.8 Flash Next Q4 GGUF 版本在同样的两张卡上运行起来，解码速度约为 26 tok/s，提示词处理性能为 380 PP。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07006bf8c043ab3a",
      "translationZh": "这并不是在宣称老款 V100 能击败现代 GPU。这只是报告一下，在这个疯狂到“买块 GPU 得卖个肾”的市场里，它们能做到什么！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32bcea16fc34d4e4",
      "translationZh": "工作负载 运行时 / 模型 最佳结果 取得该结果所用的配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "feef31e01e0fd458",
      "translationZh": "主线版 llama.cpp，Qwen3.8 27B Q6_K_M",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f583ea9ded9895a",
      "translationZh": "张量切分；主 GPU = 32 GB V100；Flash Attention；Q8 KV；batch/ubatch 2,048；20 个线程；NUMA distribute",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbffe1fd34ab6b8f",
      "translationZh": "主线版 llama.cpp，Qwen3.8 27B Q8_K_XL",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "973d668ed31e6c90",
      "translationZh": "张量切分；长上下文运行使用了 1:1.5 的切分比例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2e8f2cc7f149813",
      "translationZh": "65,536-token 提示词；张量切分比例 1:1.5",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6277a4fc6325a01a",
      "translationZh": "ik_llama 27B 的最佳结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f1ecb3c78c590f3",
      "translationZh": "在 2k 时，提示词处理速度为 670.61 tok/s；文本生成速度为 35.43 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8a80fc350d28336",
      "translationZh": "计算图拆分；1:1 拆分；批大小设置小于主线版本中的最佳配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87179aad987d331f",
