      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa094ad7185b1b5b",
      "translationZh": "103.68 GiB GGUF；据报告，MoE 总参数量为 177B / 激活参数量为 6B；计算图拆分比例为 1:1.75",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bb47b61ee80995b",
