    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9801e69682a17c51",
      "translationZh": "张量拆分，20 个线程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0ac0284670cb70d",
      "translationZh": "张量拆分，主 GPU = 32 GB V100",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4880d3c065e98289",
      "translationZh": "结论：在这对配置不均衡的 V100 上，采用张量拆分而非层拆分，以及将 32 GB V100 用作主 GPU，是决定性因素。最适合日常使用的方案是主线版 llama.cpp + Qwen3.8 27B Q6 + 张量拆分 + Flash Attention + Q8 KV + NUMA 分布。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
